#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:148 1c0fa515953c4e7586737b762d41780a
msgid ""
"Returns ``true`` when at least ``frames`` complete audio frames are queued. Zero returns "
"``true``; a negative count returns ``false``. Availability may change before another call reads "
"the data."
msgstr ""
"队列中至少有     ``frames``     个完整音频帧时返回     ``true``    。传入零返回     ``true``    ，负数返回     ``false``"
"    。后续读取前，可用帧数仍可能发生变化。"

