#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectcapture.rst:162 79e781a376ca46f8af93f5ce4b8d2759
msgid ""
"Discards all queued frames and resets "
":ref:`get_pushed_frames()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_get_pushed_frames>` and "
":ref:`get_discarded_frames()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_get_discarded_frames>` to zero."
msgstr ""
"丢弃队列中的所有帧，并将     "
":ref:`get_pushed_frames()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_get_pushed_frames>`     和     "
":ref:`get_discarded_frames()<class_FmodAudioEffectCapture_method_get_discarded_frames>`     "
"计数器归零。"

